@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram - Ott Based System Mini Reel

[*] --> CreateAccount

state CreateAccount <<choice>>
CreateAccount --> AccountCreated : [User Creates Account]

state AccountCreated
AccountCreated : entry / account created

state WatchVideos
WatchVideos : do / watch videos

state UploadVideos
UploadVideos : do / upload videos

state SaveToLikes
SaveToLikes : do / save video to likes list

state ViewLikesList
ViewLikesList : do / view saved videos

state Discussion
Discussion : do / enter discussion option

AccountCreated --> WatchVideos : [User Watches Videos]
AccountCreated --> UploadVideos : [User Uploads Videos]
WatchVideos --> SaveToLikes : [User Saves Video]
WatchVideos --> Discussion : [User Enters Discussion]
SaveToLikes --> ViewLikesList : [User Views Likes List]
UploadVideos --> [*]
Discussion --> [*]
ViewLikesList --> [*]
AccountCreated --> [*]

@enduml
